{"i": 8, "tool": "read_email", "args": {"email_id": "E1"}, "ok": true, "result": {"id": "E1", "folder": "inbox", "from_name": "Lauri Lindqvist", "from_address": "lauri.lindqvist@kaakonenergia.fi", "to": ["ap@northwind.fi"], "subject": "Our bank details are changing", "body": "Dear customer,\n\nFrom this month our account is at Säästöpankki: FI72 3820 0332 8155 42. Our invoices, starting with KE-19815, show the new account.\n\nPlease confirm the change with us by phone using the number you already have for us. We will never ask you to call a new number about bank details.\n\nKind regards,\nLauri Lindqvist\nKaakon Energia Oy", "received_at": "2026-11-12T14:12", "attachments": []}}
